WEBVTT

01:25.040 --> 01:27.400
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

03:03.760 --> 03:05.800
During the Tang Dynasty,

03:06.560 --> 03:10.000
the Cui family of Yangzhou
established a pearl farm in Hepu,

03:10.640 --> 03:12.480
supplying priceless

03:12.560 --> 03:14.360
South Sea pearls.

03:14.880 --> 03:16.920
However, due to the fierce waves,

03:17.440 --> 03:20.240
the pearl divers seldom return alive.

03:21.360 --> 03:23.480
The captors seize the divers,
ruthlessly forcing them

03:23.560 --> 03:25.720
-to gather pearls.
-Go!

03:25.800 --> 03:28.880
-For those who cannot dive,
-Hurry.

03:28.960 --> 03:31.560
men are reduced to menial labor,

03:31.640 --> 03:34.440
while women are imprisoned
to bear children,

03:35.280 --> 03:36.880
-Hurry.
-living as slaves for generations,

03:37.400 --> 03:38.880
never to be freed.

03:38.960 --> 03:39.800
I won't do it again.

03:39.880 --> 03:41.600
-Please spare me.
-Hurry up!

03:41.680 --> 03:43.520
Please release me.

03:43.600 --> 03:45.800
Go!

03:50.760 --> 03:52.560
Hurry!

03:52.640 --> 03:53.600
Move!

03:59.400 --> 04:00.760
You! Work!

04:06.880 --> 04:08.560
Hurry up! Faster!

04:14.280 --> 04:15.920
Mealtime!

04:16.519 --> 04:18.240
-Hurry, mealtime!
-Mealtime!

04:18.800 --> 04:21.440
-Mealtime.
-Hurry up!

04:22.360 --> 04:25.520
-Come on!
-Let's go.

04:28.480 --> 04:29.960
-Come on.
-Hurry!

04:41.000 --> 04:42.080
Hurry up and eat!

04:42.720 --> 04:43.920
No need to split it.

04:44.680 --> 04:45.520
Here.

04:50.160 --> 04:51.000
Okay.

04:55.240 --> 04:56.320
Split it.

04:57.520 --> 04:59.560
No, don't… Not enough?

04:59.640 --> 05:00.800
Take it. Go.

05:05.120 --> 05:06.640
-Go.
-Duanwu.

05:06.720 --> 05:09.960
Leave it to me. I'll take it.
Just go fetch the food.

05:13.160 --> 05:14.040
Split it.

05:15.160 --> 05:17.120
You, split it.

05:24.320 --> 05:26.280
What are you waiting for? Take it!

05:27.400 --> 05:28.320
Split it.

05:41.000 --> 05:42.120
Let her go.

05:51.760 --> 05:53.000
Duanwu

05:53.600 --> 05:55.800
is such a stubborn girl.

05:56.360 --> 05:59.280
Why don't you sleep with her now?

06:00.360 --> 06:02.920
She has to go
to the maternity shed someday.

06:03.480 --> 06:05.320
Let me subdue her first.

07:38.240 --> 07:39.800
Come on!

07:40.840 --> 07:42.320
You will go to the maternity shed
sooner or later.

07:50.040 --> 07:52.760
You should stay in the maternity shed

07:53.280 --> 07:56.280
to sleep with different men.

07:56.360 --> 07:58.680
Why don't you bear

07:59.200 --> 08:01.200
some children for me?

08:14.960 --> 08:16.120
If you are injured,

08:17.480 --> 08:19.400
I wonder how you will be able to dive.

10:01.160 --> 10:02.600
Let me go home!

10:07.960 --> 10:11.000
In the pearl farm,
there's only one way to survive.

10:11.080 --> 10:13.080
You must collect pearls.

10:14.240 --> 10:16.520
-I can't do it. I'm dying.
-Dying?

10:16.600 --> 10:18.560
You will die if you refuse to dive! Do it!

10:19.080 --> 10:20.920
If you don't train well now,

10:21.000 --> 10:23.240
you won't survive in the sea.

10:23.320 --> 10:25.320
-No!
-Do it!

10:25.400 --> 10:29.280
I suggest you train as much as you can,

10:29.360 --> 10:32.200
or your only option will be death.

10:35.000 --> 10:36.200
Do it!

10:37.520 --> 10:39.280
Go!

10:39.360 --> 10:41.120
Go!

10:41.200 --> 10:42.440
Go!

10:42.520 --> 10:43.600
Hurry!

10:56.960 --> 10:59.320
-Do it!
-No…

10:59.400 --> 11:02.320
I won't do it!
I want to go home! Let me go!

11:02.840 --> 11:04.600
To survive here,

11:04.680 --> 11:06.160
you must learn
to hold your breath underwater.

11:06.240 --> 11:07.520
-Go!
-Hold your breath!

11:16.800 --> 11:18.720
Cui's Pearl Farm

11:19.240 --> 11:22.280
is renowned for supplying royal pearls.

11:23.080 --> 11:26.000
Gathering pearls is an honor for you all.

11:26.960 --> 11:29.760
If you're thinking
about secretly hoarding tribute pearls,

11:29.840 --> 11:33.320
I suggest you drop that idea right now.

11:33.400 --> 11:36.360
Even though pearls get corroded

11:36.440 --> 11:40.640
by stomach acid within moments,

11:40.720 --> 11:43.120
some think they're clever enough

11:43.960 --> 11:47.480
to wrap pearls in fish intestines
and swallow them.

11:48.160 --> 11:49.880
Don't think I'm not aware of that!

11:49.960 --> 11:52.760
And those hollow hairpins!

11:52.840 --> 11:53.680
Raise your arm!

11:53.760 --> 11:55.640
Check them carefully!

12:02.080 --> 12:04.680
PEARL TOWER

12:13.360 --> 12:15.240
Steward. According to Peng Wu,

12:15.320 --> 12:17.880
this time, the pearl auction
has a distinguished guest from the West

12:17.960 --> 12:19.200
looking to acquire large pearls at 15 mm.

12:19.720 --> 12:21.560
-How many does he want?
-As many as possible.

12:21.640 --> 12:23.520
Besides,
if there are exceptionally large pearls,

12:23.600 --> 12:24.760
a premium price will be offered.

12:29.200 --> 12:30.040
Go to the pearl farm.

12:30.720 --> 12:32.480
Open your mouth! Wider!

12:33.680 --> 12:35.680
Go, go!

12:37.000 --> 12:37.920
Hurry!

12:43.960 --> 12:46.640
Lady Eight, sorry! Please spare me!

12:46.720 --> 12:47.640
Next time,
I'll definitely gather some pearls.

12:47.720 --> 12:48.560
-Take him away.
-Lady Eight!

12:48.640 --> 12:49.960
-Please spare me.
-Yes.

12:50.040 --> 12:50.880
Lady Eight.

12:50.960 --> 12:53.200
-Go.
-Don't take me to the cage!

12:53.280 --> 12:54.200
Lady Eight, don't take me to the cage!

12:54.280 --> 12:56.080
-Please spare me!
-Steward Cui is here!

12:56.160 --> 12:59.240
-Don't take me to the cage!
-What's wrong?

12:59.320 --> 13:03.040
Kneel down!

13:03.800 --> 13:05.960
-Kneel down!
-Kneel down!

13:06.040 --> 13:07.400
Kneel down!

13:09.680 --> 13:11.880
Is anyone willing to go
to Despairing Cove tomorrow?

13:11.960 --> 13:13.520
Despairing Cove?

13:13.600 --> 13:14.560
-Despairing Cove…
-It's dangerous.

13:14.640 --> 13:16.520
-Who dares to go there?
-It's full of undercurrents there.

13:16.600 --> 13:17.880
-And sharks.
-Steward.

13:17.960 --> 13:20.240
Despairing Cove is not just filled
with undercurrents and sharks.

13:20.320 --> 13:21.920
The numerous ravines are already

13:22.000 --> 13:24.080
piled with countless bones.

13:24.160 --> 13:25.400
I… I heard

13:25.480 --> 13:27.720
that many people lost their lives there.

13:27.800 --> 13:29.760
If you have any specific requirements,

13:29.840 --> 13:31.640
it will guide us in searching
for the right kind of pearls.

13:32.480 --> 13:33.760
Large pearls over 15 mm.

13:33.840 --> 13:35.840
More than 15 mm?

13:38.320 --> 13:41.120
Steward. To find large pearls over 15 mm,

13:41.200 --> 13:42.840
we need to seek out giant Tridacna clams.

13:42.920 --> 13:45.280
I heard that giant Tridacna clams
can crush a person to death!

13:45.360 --> 13:46.480
No wonder we have to go
to Despairing Cove.

13:46.560 --> 13:47.640
-Want the rewards?
-I can't go.

13:47.720 --> 13:49.200
After all, it's extremely dangerous.

13:49.280 --> 13:50.200
You will be rewarded.

13:51.840 --> 13:53.000
How about the Manumission Document?

13:53.080 --> 13:54.760
Nonsense!

13:54.840 --> 13:56.320
-I will beat you to death!
-Lady Eight.

14:00.760 --> 14:03.760
If anyone manages to find
the largest pearl over 15 mm,

14:04.280 --> 14:05.400
they will receive
a Manumission Document as a reward.

14:05.480 --> 14:07.080
Manumission Document?

14:07.160 --> 14:08.120
Give it a try?

14:08.200 --> 14:09.120
Want to lose your life?

14:09.200 --> 14:11.520
Our swimming skills may not
even allow us to survive.

14:11.600 --> 14:14.320
Yeah…

14:19.720 --> 14:20.640
Hurry!

14:30.080 --> 14:31.160
-Duanwu.
-Come on.

14:31.240 --> 14:32.120
Duanwu.

14:33.440 --> 14:36.360
My third uncle went to collect scrap.
I have to leave soon.

14:36.880 --> 14:39.160
Duanwu. I've brought you what you wanted.

14:42.480 --> 14:43.960
Why do you need the arrowheads?

14:44.040 --> 14:45.320
Did they bully you?

14:50.680 --> 14:51.640
It's okay.

14:52.480 --> 14:54.480
My third uncle was drunk.

14:55.000 --> 14:57.920
Duanwu, don't worry. I'm pretty tough.

15:05.800 --> 15:08.480
-Take it to eat.
-Thank you.

15:16.760 --> 15:17.640
Duanwu.

15:18.680 --> 15:19.800
Take care.

15:21.360 --> 15:24.160
I'm not sure when we'll meet again.

15:24.240 --> 15:26.200
My third uncle will take me away
from the pearl farm.

15:48.440 --> 15:50.080
Step aside.

15:50.600 --> 15:53.120
-Move!
-Hurry!

15:59.560 --> 16:01.600
Go!

16:03.040 --> 16:04.120
Go.

16:30.000 --> 16:32.560
Duanwu. You want to earn
the Manumission Document?

16:35.000 --> 16:36.960
But Despairing Cove is a dangerous place.

16:37.040 --> 16:39.280
And giant Tridacna clams
primarily reside on the ocean floor.

16:40.000 --> 16:41.600
It's full of undercurrents.

16:41.680 --> 16:43.880
You may not survive if you dive there.

16:49.720 --> 16:51.560
Don't worry. I know what to do.

16:51.640 --> 16:53.200
Duanwu. If…

16:53.720 --> 16:56.440
If you leave,
how will I manage to live here alone?

16:56.520 --> 16:58.480
If I can get the Tridacna pearl,

16:59.800 --> 17:01.160
I will try

17:02.800 --> 17:04.200
to take you away from here.

17:17.960 --> 17:19.280
Eight hundred thousand maces.

17:20.079 --> 17:21.280
Thank you.

17:26.240 --> 17:27.160
Mister.

17:27.240 --> 17:28.640
This golden hairpin

17:28.720 --> 17:30.720
is adorned with dozens
of Hepu South Sea pearls,

17:30.800 --> 17:31.800
each perfectly round.

17:31.880 --> 17:34.280
The rubies are equally vibrant in color.

17:34.360 --> 17:38.360
The quotation is 500,000 maces.
Please accept this.

17:38.440 --> 17:40.680
How dare you present such a thing?

17:42.200 --> 17:43.040
Get lost.

17:44.280 --> 17:48.720
Our things are much better than these.

17:49.240 --> 17:50.560
Please be patient.

17:50.640 --> 17:53.480
Mister, please check my bracelet.

17:54.880 --> 17:58.520
This bracelet is crafted
from three strands of Hetian jade,

17:59.040 --> 18:02.080
featuring a delicate texture
and a lustrous sheen.

18:03.440 --> 18:04.480
My quotation is 800,000 maces.

18:05.400 --> 18:06.840
800,000?

18:06.920 --> 18:10.880
It's valued at over 800,000.
Accountant Wei,

18:12.200 --> 18:14.360
-two million maces.
-Two million maces?

18:15.640 --> 18:17.320
This Western Region merchant
is quite wealthy!

18:17.400 --> 18:19.040
It's like throwing money around!

18:20.040 --> 18:21.360
Why didn't I bring
some goods to sell as well?

18:30.960 --> 18:33.480
In our Western Regions,
selling counterfeit goods means

18:34.320 --> 18:35.160
losing your tongue and hands.

18:36.360 --> 18:38.760
-No!
-Losing his tongue and hands?

18:45.280 --> 18:46.520
Wait!

18:51.000 --> 18:52.280
According to the laws of the Tang Dynasty,

18:52.880 --> 18:55.160
selling counterfeit goods
only results in 80 lashes.

18:55.760 --> 18:57.920
How can you be so cruel?

18:58.000 --> 18:59.240
Who are you?

18:59.840 --> 19:02.440
I'm just a wandering scholar.

19:03.040 --> 19:05.240
As merchants, we have our rules.

19:05.320 --> 19:08.600
Based on your rules, how can I save him?

19:08.680 --> 19:10.000
As merchants,
our only concern is business.

19:11.560 --> 19:13.560
Master is here.

19:18.720 --> 19:19.680
Master.

19:21.000 --> 19:23.280
-It's all about the money.
-Master.

19:30.240 --> 19:34.360
Wait, we are going to Despairing Cove.

19:34.440 --> 19:35.640
Take more

19:35.720 --> 19:37.360
to dive deeper.

19:38.040 --> 19:38.960
Easy.

19:44.720 --> 19:45.560
Take more.

19:49.480 --> 19:53.800
Put it down.
You also want to go to Despairing Cove?

19:54.360 --> 19:57.160
Don't you know your capability?

20:00.800 --> 20:02.200
I told you to put it down!

20:02.720 --> 20:05.600
Do you want to die
before you earn enough for the pearl farm?

20:06.600 --> 20:09.000
The pearl farm has always
traded lives for pearls.

20:09.560 --> 20:10.480
Stop being hypocritical.

20:10.560 --> 20:13.600
How dare you talk back? Drag her away!

20:15.280 --> 20:17.120
Stop! Release her!

20:17.200 --> 20:18.520
-Release her!
-Steward Cui…

20:18.600 --> 20:21.440
-Steward Cui…
-Steward Cui issued the order!

20:24.840 --> 20:26.760
Steward Cui ordered us
to go to Despairing Cove.

20:27.520 --> 20:28.360
Who dares to disobey him?

20:41.480 --> 20:42.320
Mr. Peng.

20:43.440 --> 20:44.440
Master Yan.

20:46.440 --> 20:48.560
Since this gentleman
wants to be accommodating,

20:49.520 --> 20:50.680
please tell me your offer.

20:50.760 --> 20:52.760
I have a priceless pearl

20:53.280 --> 20:54.520
that has been treasured
for three generations.

20:54.600 --> 20:55.680
Three generations?

20:55.760 --> 20:57.520
I wonder if it's worth his life.

20:58.040 --> 20:59.080
Do they know each other?

20:59.160 --> 21:01.640
Such a precious pearl!

21:11.200 --> 21:14.280
A pearl that has been treasured
for three generations?

21:15.680 --> 21:17.400
Are you kidding me?

21:18.920 --> 21:21.360
The pearls come from the rivers and seas,

21:21.440 --> 21:22.760
hidden within oysters.

21:23.760 --> 21:26.600
My pearl was obtained from the deep sea.

21:26.680 --> 21:27.600
So, it's extremely precious.

21:27.680 --> 21:30.240
It's quite different
from the ordinary pearls.

21:30.320 --> 21:33.320
It's lustrous and smooth.
My grandpa treasures it highly.

21:36.480 --> 21:38.200
This box is pretty delicate.

21:39.160 --> 21:40.800
I'd like to offer 500,000 maces
for the box.

21:41.360 --> 21:44.160
But you may keep the pearl.

21:45.320 --> 21:46.440
It's a pearl.

21:47.600 --> 21:48.560
So what?

21:48.640 --> 21:51.320
As a jeweler, you don't
recognize its true worth!

21:51.400 --> 21:54.080
Though it's better than ordinary pearls,

21:54.600 --> 21:57.520
basically speaking,
it's still an inferior pearl.

21:57.600 --> 21:58.600
So, it's not valuable at all.

21:58.680 --> 22:00.000
Don't try to deceive me.

22:00.520 --> 22:02.760
I've seen pearls of good quality.

22:03.280 --> 22:05.280
Besides the emperor's pearls in Chang'an,

22:05.960 --> 22:09.960
mine is the finest available
in the market.

22:12.360 --> 22:13.200
How about this?

22:15.560 --> 22:17.480
Are you willing to make a bet with me?

22:17.560 --> 22:19.080
I'll show you a place.

22:19.600 --> 22:22.640
If the pearls there
are inferior to this one,

22:23.240 --> 22:25.360
I will pay five million maces for it.

22:25.880 --> 22:26.800
Besides,

22:27.800 --> 22:28.800
I will spare his life.

22:28.880 --> 22:31.240
Master, please spare me.

22:31.320 --> 22:34.920
Otherwise, you'll have
to give it to me for free.

22:36.480 --> 22:37.800
A real man never

22:38.600 --> 22:41.320
-goes back on his words.
-Sure.

22:44.320 --> 22:45.640
What?

22:45.720 --> 22:48.200
-Mr. Peng is unhappy with it?
-Not at all.

22:48.280 --> 22:50.960
Master Yan is a distinguished guest
of the pearl farm.

22:53.680 --> 22:55.320
Five million is not a small amount.

23:05.680 --> 23:06.640
Duanwu.

23:07.440 --> 23:08.480
Do take care.

23:09.280 --> 23:11.680
I will. You too. Take care!

23:23.280 --> 23:25.040
Despairing Cove is just ahead!

23:27.840 --> 23:29.000
Are you okay?

23:31.680 --> 23:34.360
Duanwu, it's too dangerous here.

23:34.880 --> 23:38.720
What if I can't return alive? Duanwu.

23:38.800 --> 23:40.120
What to do?

23:40.800 --> 23:42.840
Stay here and wait for me. Wait for me.

23:51.240 --> 23:52.720
Give me your sandbag. Hurry.

23:54.680 --> 23:58.880
Be careful!
I'll be waiting for you, Duanwu!

24:49.560 --> 24:51.560
Why did they venture into the deep sea?

24:51.640 --> 24:54.600
They're diving to collect pearls.

24:55.480 --> 24:58.560
Wide seas where fish and dragons cross.

24:59.080 --> 25:00.640
High skies echo with the cries of gulls.

25:01.200 --> 25:02.800
Amidst the shimmering waves,

25:03.320 --> 25:04.600
the merman holds pearls in his palm.

25:04.680 --> 25:07.200
Wonderful poem!

25:08.240 --> 25:11.480
I'd like to show you
something interesting.

25:11.560 --> 25:14.920
-Bring me some fish blood.
-Yes.

25:21.800 --> 25:23.240
Watch carefully.

25:29.600 --> 25:30.520
What's this for?

25:31.120 --> 25:33.000
Sharks love blood.

25:50.280 --> 25:51.200
How could you do that?

25:51.280 --> 25:55.000
Since they are diving into the deep sea,
they are risking their lives.

25:56.360 --> 25:58.600
-Just for collecting the pearls?
-Of course.

25:58.680 --> 25:59.800
Pearls are valuable indeed.

26:00.400 --> 26:02.720
But how can they be worth a human life?

26:02.800 --> 26:06.200
If you can't accept this,

26:06.800 --> 26:10.760
I suggest you go home early
to enjoy your calm life.

30:10.480 --> 30:11.560
Where is Duanwu?

30:12.120 --> 30:13.480
Where is Duanwu?

30:17.400 --> 30:18.680
Duanwu!

30:18.760 --> 30:22.000
-Sharks are nearby. Let's go now!
-Why hasn't Duanwu come back?

30:22.080 --> 30:24.440
Duanwu!

30:24.520 --> 30:25.880
If you keep shouting,

30:25.960 --> 30:28.520
I will toss you into the sea
to feed the sharks.

30:30.520 --> 30:31.360
Let's go.

30:59.000 --> 31:02.640
Duanwu is alive! She's still alive!

31:04.000 --> 31:06.840
Hurry. Pick her up!

31:07.360 --> 31:08.520
Hurry!

31:11.640 --> 31:12.720
One superior pearl.

31:13.320 --> 31:14.480
Four small pearls.

31:18.160 --> 31:19.120
Three superior pearls.

31:20.440 --> 31:22.440
Good-for-nothing! Drag him away.

31:23.520 --> 31:25.280
One large pearl at 15 mm.

31:27.240 --> 31:30.240
It's collected by Duanwu.

31:33.760 --> 31:34.760
There is one even bigger!

31:38.320 --> 31:40.640
Look. This one is the largest.

31:41.400 --> 31:43.520
This is collected by Gou.

31:47.200 --> 31:48.960
This is the largest pearl at over 15 mm.

31:49.600 --> 31:52.200
Thank you! Please grant me
the Manumission Document.

31:53.160 --> 31:55.360
-Okay.
-Thank you!

31:55.880 --> 31:57.880
I collected the largest pearl!

31:58.400 --> 31:59.800
Did you make a mistake?

31:59.880 --> 32:01.160
Nonsense!

32:01.720 --> 32:03.440
How could I make a mistake?

32:03.520 --> 32:04.880
No way!

32:06.320 --> 32:09.080
This was collected by me! I collected it!

32:10.000 --> 32:11.000
Go away!

32:11.080 --> 32:12.720
-Lady Eight!
-Go away!

32:12.800 --> 32:13.640
Or I will lash you to death.

32:13.720 --> 32:15.680
You changed it.

32:17.200 --> 32:19.880
-Steward Cui…
-Go away!

32:19.960 --> 32:22.000
-Drag her away!
-I collected this.

32:22.080 --> 32:23.560
-Steward Cui!
-Lady Eight!

32:23.640 --> 32:24.600
-Go away!
-I collected it!

32:24.680 --> 32:26.120
-Drag her away!
-I collected it!

32:26.640 --> 32:28.400
I collected it!

32:29.800 --> 32:33.280
I collected it! Steward Cui!

32:35.120 --> 32:36.280
Steward Cui.

32:37.080 --> 32:39.680
After all, she collected
one large pearl at 15 mm.

32:39.760 --> 32:41.200
How about letting Duanwu

32:41.280 --> 32:43.280
be a pearl hostess at the pearl auction?

32:43.360 --> 32:46.040
She has a pretty face.

32:47.080 --> 32:48.440
Let her be a pearl hostess then.

32:49.560 --> 32:50.920
Thank you.

33:01.560 --> 33:03.880
You are lucky to come back alive.

33:04.600 --> 33:05.720
Have the medicine.

33:08.520 --> 33:09.720
I don't understand.

33:10.400 --> 33:11.760
Why did you do that?

33:13.000 --> 33:14.440
No reason.

33:15.240 --> 33:17.360
Do you think you can
really escape from here?

33:17.880 --> 33:20.600
There is only one way
to get rid of the pearl farm.

33:21.120 --> 33:22.080
Death.

33:25.600 --> 33:26.920
Being a pearl hostess

33:27.000 --> 33:29.360
is your only option.

33:35.520 --> 33:37.240
Let Lala be the pearl hostess too.

33:40.720 --> 33:42.480
Check the account books.

33:43.080 --> 33:45.000
What do you think of the scenery?

33:45.080 --> 33:46.440
Compared to the Western Regions,

33:46.520 --> 33:47.840
it's not very satisfying.

33:50.080 --> 33:51.080
It's been a while.

33:51.160 --> 33:53.240
Mr. Peng is doing well.

33:53.320 --> 33:54.800
Thank you.

33:54.880 --> 33:57.680
Since we are following the right master,
I believe your pearl farm

33:57.760 --> 33:59.280
will surely thrive.

33:59.360 --> 34:00.480
Yeah.

34:02.440 --> 34:04.160
-And this is…
-This is the distinguished guest

34:04.240 --> 34:07.080
from the State of Kang,
here to purchase the 15 mm large pearls.

34:09.560 --> 34:11.560
-Nice to meet you.
-Nice to meet you.

34:12.080 --> 34:14.639
I'm Cui Ding. May I have your name?

34:14.719 --> 34:17.320
I'm surnamed Yan.

34:22.440 --> 34:26.199
You look quite familiar to me.

34:28.719 --> 34:31.120
Unfortunately, I don't remember
if we've met before.

34:31.199 --> 34:32.960
You have no idea.

34:33.480 --> 34:35.920
The previous master of this pearl farm

34:36.000 --> 34:36.960
is also a Yan.

34:38.920 --> 34:41.280
Maybe you are distant relatives?

34:42.400 --> 34:44.000
Mind your words.

34:44.520 --> 34:48.600
I heard that the Yan family
was executed in full.

34:50.719 --> 34:52.960
Are you living in the Western Region?

34:53.040 --> 34:54.520
His foundation is in the Western Regions,

34:54.600 --> 34:57.480
but he also conducts business
in Quanzhou and Yangzhou.

34:58.360 --> 35:00.920
Just do business.
I pay for the goods and I will leave.

35:01.440 --> 35:02.560
Is it really necessary
to ask so many questions?

35:04.160 --> 35:05.320
Sorry.

35:05.960 --> 35:08.800
I will show you the best pearls.

35:08.880 --> 35:11.080
I want the large pearls at 15 mm.

35:11.160 --> 35:13.400
I have all kinds of pearls.

35:14.160 --> 35:15.480
But I heard

35:15.560 --> 35:17.720
a batch of Persian pearls
was brought in from Persia recently,

35:17.800 --> 35:18.880
and they are also quite good.

35:19.400 --> 35:22.040
It seems that South Sea pearls
are devalued.

35:22.120 --> 35:23.160
Hepu South Sea pearls

35:23.240 --> 35:25.680
have been designated as royal tributes
for three consecutive years.

35:26.200 --> 35:29.080
How can Persian pearls
be compared to them?

35:29.800 --> 35:30.640
Please.

35:31.160 --> 35:32.440
-Please.
-Please.

35:34.480 --> 35:38.240
PEARL TOWER

35:43.720 --> 35:45.320
Can I make it?

35:56.520 --> 35:58.400
I'm also worried about it.

35:59.360 --> 36:01.680
How can you sell the pearls
with your long faces?

36:02.560 --> 36:03.480
I'm telling you,

36:04.000 --> 36:05.760
all the guests here are distinguished!

36:05.840 --> 36:08.000
If any of them are fond of you,

36:08.080 --> 36:10.480
you'll have a wealthy life.

36:10.560 --> 36:11.840
Understood?

36:12.440 --> 36:14.280
Yes.

36:56.800 --> 36:58.440
Duanwu, what are you doing?

36:58.520 --> 36:59.360
Come on!

37:03.720 --> 37:06.080
My brother thinks
the Hepu tribute pearls are fishy.

37:06.680 --> 37:08.760
That's why he sent me here
to investigate it.

37:09.960 --> 37:11.440
This is the best chance.

37:11.520 --> 37:13.240
So lively.

37:13.760 --> 37:15.600
No matter why Master Yan

37:16.440 --> 37:19.600
took us here,
let's just observe the situation.

37:20.680 --> 37:23.400
The Cui family's South Sea Pearls
have been tribute pearls for three years,

37:23.480 --> 37:26.120
gaining great fame.
It's reasonable that they are wealthy.

37:26.200 --> 37:27.200
Indeed.

37:28.240 --> 37:30.120
They have a thriving business,

37:30.640 --> 37:32.120
but the amount
of tribute pearls is decreasing.

37:32.640 --> 37:33.560
That's unreasonable.

37:35.120 --> 37:37.880
Are you saying that the Cui family
is selling tribute pearls privately?

37:37.960 --> 37:40.880
Or what?
They make the auction so mysterious.

37:43.080 --> 37:43.960
Let's go have a look.

38:08.840 --> 38:10.440
She looks nice.

38:11.240 --> 38:12.080
Buzzkill!

38:12.160 --> 38:13.320
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

38:19.400 --> 38:20.360
Thank you.

38:21.240 --> 38:22.160
Not a big deal.

38:24.520 --> 38:26.720
Duanwu, come on!

38:27.480 --> 38:28.720
Steward. For this auction,

38:28.800 --> 38:30.240
all the pearls
have already been allocated.

38:30.320 --> 38:32.120
Only this most precious
giant pearl remains.

38:32.200 --> 38:34.800
Who do you think should be
the final pearl hostess?

38:35.400 --> 38:38.360
When choosing a pearl hostess,
it's not about looks or figures.

38:38.440 --> 38:40.280
It's about their sales skills.

38:42.760 --> 38:45.280
Who wants to be the final pearl hostess?

38:46.080 --> 38:46.920
-Me!
-Let me.

38:47.000 --> 38:48.160
Me!

38:48.240 --> 38:49.880
The price of this pearl
is five million maces.

38:49.960 --> 38:50.800
Who can sell it?

38:50.880 --> 38:51.720
Well…

38:51.800 --> 38:53.240
Five million…

39:00.840 --> 39:03.200
Steward Cui, I'd like to have a try.

39:03.280 --> 39:04.800
All of them dare not to do it.

39:05.320 --> 39:06.680
Why do you think you can make it?

39:08.160 --> 39:10.040
This giant Tridacna pearl

39:10.960 --> 39:12.040
was collected by me in person.

39:12.840 --> 39:14.560
I want to showcase its true value.

39:14.640 --> 39:15.640
Do you know

39:15.720 --> 39:17.880
what the highest price for pearls
has been in recent years?

39:17.960 --> 39:19.000
Yes.

39:20.240 --> 39:21.560
Four million maces.

39:21.640 --> 39:23.320
But since Steward Cui

39:23.840 --> 39:25.360
said it's worth five million maces,

39:25.440 --> 39:27.240
that's its true value.

39:27.320 --> 39:29.160
What a silver tongue!

39:29.240 --> 39:30.960
Want to be rewarded again?

39:35.240 --> 39:38.240
Steward Cui,
if I can sell it for five million maces,

39:38.320 --> 39:40.480
I only want two Manumission Documents.

39:40.560 --> 39:42.840
One for me, the other for Lala.

39:43.440 --> 39:44.680
What a clever girl!

39:44.760 --> 39:46.480
You are so clever

39:46.560 --> 39:50.360
that I almost forgot
that you were a pearl diver.

39:52.360 --> 39:53.560
Seven million maces.

39:54.680 --> 39:55.560
You will have the Manumission Documents.

39:56.680 --> 39:58.600
Sell it for seven million,
and you're free.

39:59.120 --> 40:01.080
If you fail, you will die.

40:04.760 --> 40:06.640
Still confident?

40:06.720 --> 40:08.280
Steward Cui. Steward…

40:08.360 --> 40:10.400
-So eager to show off?
-Duanwu.

40:10.480 --> 40:12.440
Does she think some wealthy guest
will be fond of her?

40:12.520 --> 40:14.480
-Who will pay so much for her?
-Duanwu.

40:15.280 --> 40:17.440
Seven million!

40:17.520 --> 40:19.360
Who can pay seven million maces?

40:19.440 --> 40:20.600
Seven million?

40:20.680 --> 40:22.440
Isn't it easy to buy her freedom as well?

40:24.360 --> 40:26.040
This pearl is so pretty.

40:26.120 --> 40:27.360
Indeed.

40:28.440 --> 40:29.720
I think mine is also beautiful.

40:34.240 --> 40:36.640
Look at her dazed face.

40:37.680 --> 40:39.480
I wonder how she will sell it later.

40:40.600 --> 40:43.640
Seven million? She won't make it.

40:44.160 --> 40:45.440
Yes.

40:45.520 --> 40:46.480
I wonder

40:46.560 --> 40:48.840
how she will sell it.

40:48.920 --> 40:50.720
She's not capable at all.

40:50.800 --> 40:52.440
She knows some tricks only.

40:52.520 --> 40:54.920
Later, let's dance well.

40:55.000 --> 40:56.720
-Of course.
-Rest assured.

40:58.720 --> 41:01.240
Here comes the next batch
of pearl hostesses.

41:55.080 --> 41:56.600
That pearl.

41:57.120 --> 41:58.320
That one.

42:00.760 --> 42:01.960
That one.

42:02.040 --> 42:03.960
I like that one.
